# CLAUDE.md

This file provides guidance to Claude Code (claude.ai/code) when working with code in this repository.

## What this project is

A **Drupal 11 contribution workbench** — a local environment for contributing patches and MRs to Drupal.org contrib modules. There is no custom application code. All work targets modules under `web/modules/contrib/`.

The entry point for any contribution task is the **`drupal-issue-agent`** — give it an issue URL or NID and it handles the full lifecycle.

---

## Local environment (DDEV)

| Detail | Value |
|---|---|
| Project name | `{{DDEV_PROJECT}}` |
| Site URL | `{{SITE_URL}}` |
| PHP | {{PHP_VERSION}} |
| Database | MariaDB {{MARIADB_VERSION}} |
| Docroot | `web/` |

Always use `ddev drush` and `ddev composer` — never bare `drush` or `composer`.

Claude Code runs inside the container via the `ddev-assistant-claude` addon. `phpcs`, `phpcbf`, `phpunit`, and `phpstan` are all on PATH inside ddev.

