## Running tests (PHPUnit)

**Unit tests** — no database needed:
```bash
ddev exec phpunit \
  --bootstrap /var/www/html/web/core/tests/bootstrap.php \
  /var/www/html/web/modules/contrib/<module>/tests/src/Unit
```

**Kernel and Functional tests** — require database and base URL:
```bash
ddev exec bash -c "
  SIMPLETEST_BASE_URL={{SITE_URL}} \
  SIMPLETEST_DB=mysql://db:db@db/db \
  phpunit --bootstrap /var/www/html/web/core/tests/bootstrap.php \
  /var/www/html/web/modules/contrib/<module>/tests/src/Kernel
"
```

**Filter to a single test:**
```bash
ddev exec bash -c "
  SIMPLETEST_BASE_URL={{SITE_URL}} \
  SIMPLETEST_DB=mysql://db:db@db/db \
  phpunit --bootstrap /var/www/html/web/core/tests/bootstrap.php \
  --filter testMethodName \
  /var/www/html/web/modules/contrib/<module>/tests/src
"
```

